  "label": "Concept: Roadside Memorial",
  "description": "A memorial placed at the side of a road to honor a deceased person, often after a fatal accident. These memorials are common in many cultures and are used to express grief and remembrance. In this meme, the memorial is used as a visual symbol of tragedy and loss.",
